    <string id="ui_mcm_roguelite_stash_item_condition_loss_percent">
        <text>死亡降低物品耐久百分比</text>		 
    </string>
    <!--Player Corpse Settings-->
    <string id="ui_mcm_roguelite_drop_player_inventory_description">
        <text>玩家屍體留存</text>
    </string>
    <string id="ui_mcm_roguelite_drop_player_inventory_on_death_enabled">
        <text>繼承最後一次死亡的屍體</text>
    </string>
    <string id="ui_mcm_roguelite_drop_player_inventory_item_loss_chance">
        <text>物品丟失機率</text>
    </string>
	<string id="ui_mcm_roguelite_drop_player_inventory_item_loss_chance_desc">
		<text>這個機率是針對每個物品, 並不是最終實際丟失的數量比例, 比如25%機率的意思是包裹中每個物品都會有25%機率丟失</text>
	</string>
    <string id="ui_mcm_roguelite_drop_player_inventory_item_loss_max_ingame_time_enabled">
        <text>啟用物品隨時間流逝而丟失</text>
    </string>
    <string id="ui_mcm_roguelite_drop_player_inventory_item_loss_max_ingame_time_seconds">
        <text>以秒為單位設定物品丟失, 並應用"物品丟失機率"參數</text>
    </string>
	<string id="ui_mcm_roguelite_drop_player_inventory_item_loss_max_ingame_time_seconds_desc">
		<text>舉例: 物品丟失機率為25%, 丟失時間為1小時的話, 你作為獨行者在軍事倉庫死亡, 復活后你花了45分鐘時間抵達屍體處, 你會發現物品丟失的百分比為0.75 * 0.25 * 100% = 19%, 因為你只花了3/4小時就取得了屍體, 如果是1小時的話則會丟失25%的物品
</text>
	</string>								 

